The sauce was divine and those potatoes left me wanting a double-triple-double helping lol. The mimosa was pretty good and they have..."},{"business_id":"7fSehNL4pBJ26FOeLqPj1g","review_id":"Ql88nbRUTX3VRoHtidme_Q","date":"2015-07-12T19:19:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9237340688705444,"text_excerpt":"I have been wanting to try out this sweet little place in mid-city for a long time. Today was the day! I am going to put this place into rotation when we want a \"nice place to go\"; a cloth napkin kind of place, you know? It was brunching at it's finest. Mimosas made with pulpy fresh orange juice; available by the pitcher. There were so many good things on the menu it took us a while to decide what to choose from the fantastic options. Our table finally ordered the chicken and waffles (served with REAL maple syrup), the Bayou St. John, which is a stack of crab cake and latke with quail eggs and a poblano cream sauce (whoa.), and a couple of omelets (they do the thin rolled kind - YUM.) wit..."},{"business_id":"7fSehNL4pBJ26FOeLqPj1g","review_id":"3gZ0YswTv5KIbPfYRxLCBg","date":"2017-12-08T18:22:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9231216907501221,"text_excerpt":"This place is great! Everyone who works there is so nice and I have spent a lot of time just chatting with them. It's always an enjoyable and pleasant experience. I have bought multiple people here over the last few weeks and I will say the crab cakes are a big hit! As a vegan, I can recommend the avocado and quinoa salad (it tastes so much more exciting than it sounds - promise!). Also, try the esquites as they are divine (agreed with by meat-eaters, too). They are very knowledgable about their food and can tell you off the top of their heads what is vegan and what is not, including any substitutes they can make to make something vegan. Same goes with gluten-free. I will say it's not the..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7fSehNL4pBJ26FOeLqPj1g","photo_id":"LIK-XpDfb0HRm3I2f6EE_A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LIK-XpDfb0HRm3I2f6EE_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.93684321641922},{"business_id":"7fSehNL4pBJ26FOeLqPj1g","photo_id":"Y9Jv5MqbZoNH97nqcAQVyg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Y9Jv5MqbZoNH97nqcAQVyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8621412515640259},{"business_id":"7fSehNL4pBJ26FOeLqPj1g","photo_id":"VrsHyi6t91LDOgCP_MUQAw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VrsHyi6t91LDOgCP_MUQAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.833234429359436},{"business_id":"7fSehNL4pBJ26FOeLqPj1g","photo_id":"QwAZ9bwOIW7_y4S_xnoJoA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QwAZ9bwOIW7_y4S_xnoJoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7991280555725098},{"business_id":"7fSehNL4pBJ26FOeLqPj1g","photo_id":"Co-NI5mtbBsLPPr47omo1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Co-NI5mtbBsLPPr47omo1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7801705002784729}]},"notebook_case":null}
